WEBVTT

01:29.720 --> 01:32.830
[Cage of Shadows]

01:33.560 --> 01:36.090
[Episode 5]

01:37.280 --> 01:38.039
Master.

01:45.990 --> 01:46.950
It's you.

01:47.990 --> 01:49.320
What are you doing here?

01:57.360 --> 01:59.479
You mean she didn't kill you?

02:00.250 --> 02:02.650
Now that I see you're all right,
I can relax.

02:07.290 --> 02:08.360
You mean

02:08.539 --> 02:09.740
she brought you here?

02:11.600 --> 02:12.520
Then I guess

02:13.040 --> 02:14.470
she sent you to keep an eye on me

02:14.470 --> 02:16.470
so I wouldn't do anything reckless.

02:20.420 --> 02:21.260
Qi?

02:24.300 --> 02:25.300
That's your name?

02:27.370 --> 02:29.510
Then I'll just call you Qi from now on.

02:42.270 --> 02:43.910
Tomorrow's exam questions?

02:45.070 --> 02:46.410
How did you get this?

02:50.300 --> 02:52.100
Did she ask you to give this to me?

02:58.310 --> 03:00.030
On Choosing a Husband...

03:07.720 --> 03:09.560
In the eyes of the world,

03:09.580 --> 03:10.960
once a woman comes of age,

03:10.960 --> 03:13.080
the most important matter in her life
is choosing a husband.

03:13.080 --> 03:14.320
I have already taught you much

03:14.320 --> 03:16.680
about the principles women
are expected to follow

03:16.680 --> 03:18.340
and the proper way to conduct yourselves.

03:18.340 --> 03:20.770
Based on what you have learned,

03:20.920 --> 03:22.800
write an essay on the subject

03:22.880 --> 03:24.140
of choosing a husband.

03:24.160 --> 03:25.079
You will have 2 hours

03:25.079 --> 03:26.480
to complete the exam.

03:26.600 --> 03:27.940
Unless you turn in your paper,

03:27.940 --> 03:29.640
you may not leave the examination hall.

03:29.640 --> 03:30.920
You may begin.

03:35.560 --> 03:37.220
[On Choosing a Husband]

03:45.880 --> 03:47.420
Everyone will remain here

03:47.560 --> 03:49.260
for the next 2 hours.

03:50.040 --> 03:52.680
This is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.

04:14.000 --> 04:15.660
At this rate, just copying
all of this down

04:15.660 --> 04:17.579
will take until
it's time to hand in the paper.

04:17.579 --> 04:19.980
How am I supposed to investigate anything?

04:40.780 --> 04:42.680
[Teammate]

04:50.110 --> 04:51.310
What is she doing?

04:51.409 --> 04:53.330
Is she turning in a blank exam paper?

04:53.330 --> 04:54.860
She's totally unreliable.

04:54.990 --> 04:55.790
Wait.

05:01.080 --> 05:02.250
What is it, Madam?

05:02.470 --> 05:03.950
Didn't I just say

05:04.060 --> 05:05.300
that no one is allowed

05:05.360 --> 05:06.940
to leave the examination hall
during the exam?

05:06.940 --> 05:07.660
Madam,

05:07.920 --> 05:09.220
I've already finished my paper.

05:09.220 --> 05:10.810
Are you certain
you're handing it in just like this?

05:10.810 --> 05:12.260
I've already finished my paper.

05:12.260 --> 05:13.570
Am I not allowed to turn it in?

05:13.570 --> 05:16.130
Do you know what happens to those

05:16.640 --> 05:18.380
who don't take the exam seriously?

05:18.380 --> 05:19.740
I did take it seriously.

05:20.480 --> 05:21.820
Everything I wanted to say—

05:21.820 --> 05:23.670
and could say—on this topic

05:23.720 --> 05:25.050
is already on the paper.

05:25.360 --> 05:26.970
Unless I misheard
or overlooked something,

05:26.970 --> 05:29.290
I don't believe you specified
a minimum word count, Madam.

05:29.290 --> 05:31.150
You'd better think this through.

05:31.200 --> 05:33.090
Once you leave this examination hall,

05:33.090 --> 05:34.250
it'll be too late

05:34.580 --> 05:35.800
to regret.

05:37.120 --> 05:39.050
Thank you for the reminder, Madam.

05:58.840 --> 06:00.900
She's really impossible to count on.

06:12.510 --> 06:15.940
[Teammate]

06:31.320 --> 06:32.120
I'm already out.

06:32.120 --> 06:33.780
There's no way I'm going back.

06:34.010 --> 06:35.400
If you make any more noise,

06:35.400 --> 06:37.200
you'll only get me into trouble.

06:38.800 --> 06:39.840
I know what I'm doing.

06:39.840 --> 06:40.520
Let's go.

06:50.830 --> 06:52.320
The moment I approached this place
last night,

06:52.320 --> 06:53.310
I was stopped.

06:54.180 --> 06:56.980
There must be something
suspicious going on here.

07:00.880 --> 07:03.200
Looks like there's something
hidden underneath.

07:03.200 --> 07:04.140
I'll go down and take a look.

07:04.140 --> 07:05.340
Keep an eye out for me.

07:05.740 --> 07:06.420
It's fine.

08:49.040 --> 08:51.700
Looks like she's obsessed
with being a teacher.

08:55.330 --> 08:56.250
Master.

08:56.270 --> 08:57.660
I don't like being lied to.

08:57.660 --> 08:59.050
Can you at least give me
some peace of mind?

08:59.050 --> 09:00.010
Master,

09:00.300 --> 09:01.450
things have already come to this point.

09:01.450 --> 09:02.400
Either keep me by your side

09:02.400 --> 09:03.830
and let me act under your watch,

09:03.830 --> 09:05.320
or keep everything from me

09:05.470 --> 09:07.180
and let me learn things
the hard way myself.

09:07.180 --> 09:08.690
The worst that can happen is I die.

09:08.690 --> 09:10.090
How dare you threaten me?

09:10.360 --> 09:11.790
Master...

09:23.040 --> 09:23.960
Master...

09:24.200 --> 09:25.000
W-What

09:25.330 --> 09:25.990
is this?

09:26.860 --> 09:29.250
The toxin has already reached
the back of the brain.

09:29.250 --> 09:30.580
She won't wake up again.

09:35.330 --> 09:36.290
The antidote.

09:36.310 --> 09:37.840
The antidote for my mother!

09:49.720 --> 09:50.980
I've already checked.

09:51.080 --> 09:52.480
The antidote isn't here.

09:54.070 --> 09:54.870
Look at this.

09:55.830 --> 09:56.370
[No. 5]

09:56.370 --> 09:56.850
[No. 4]

09:56.850 --> 09:57.360
[No. 3]

09:57.360 --> 09:58.070
[No. 2]

09:57.680 --> 09:58.770
These...

09:58.120 --> 10:00.210
[No. 1]

09:59.320 --> 10:00.440
Could these be...

10:00.560 --> 10:01.360
That's right.

10:02.280 --> 10:03.800
Different rankings

10:04.030 --> 10:05.830
are given different medicines.

10:06.630 --> 10:07.460
[No. 1]

10:07.000 --> 10:08.920
No wonder some of them are unconscious,

10:08.920 --> 10:10.600
while others are already like puppets.

10:10.600 --> 10:12.140
They're using people as test subjects.

10:12.140 --> 10:15.000
All the students on this floor
have become their drugged puppets.

10:15.000 --> 10:16.200
And that's precisely

10:16.720 --> 10:18.680
how Lingya Tower controls

10:19.000 --> 10:21.170
those so-called nobles—with these drugs.

10:21.170 --> 10:23.400
This medicine causes hallucinations,

10:23.420 --> 10:25.640
making people feel as if they've entered
a state of ultimate bliss—

10:25.640 --> 10:27.760
so intense it's almost uncontrollable.

10:27.760 --> 10:29.090
Once they've tasted it,

10:29.240 --> 10:31.170
they become hooked on the feeling.

10:31.410 --> 10:32.120
[No. 1]

10:33.880 --> 10:35.470
And this is supposed to be a reward

10:35.470 --> 10:36.490
for the top-ranked student?

10:36.490 --> 10:38.250
These drugs may be addictive,

10:38.280 --> 10:40.460
but at least those
who take them still retain some sanity.

10:40.460 --> 10:41.380
The other drugs

10:42.160 --> 10:43.040
are even worse.

10:43.210 --> 10:45.770
If they were all nothing but puppets,

10:46.550 --> 10:48.850
she probably wouldn't get
her fill as a teacher.

10:48.850 --> 10:51.370
So she lets the high-performing
students keep their minds,

10:51.370 --> 10:53.050
while the weaker ones

10:53.450 --> 10:54.740
are reduced to toys

10:54.960 --> 10:56.620
for her to manipulate at will.

11:02.610 --> 11:03.650
I get it now.

11:03.940 --> 11:05.320
Qin Yuren controls those puppets

11:05.320 --> 11:06.600
through the sound of bells.

11:06.600 --> 11:07.840
Maybe we can use that against her.

11:07.840 --> 11:09.800
Let's set Qin Yuren aside for now.

11:10.240 --> 11:11.200
Shouldn't you

11:11.880 --> 11:13.540
be taking your exam right now?

11:14.590 --> 11:15.680
I've already finished my exam.

11:15.680 --> 11:17.080
That fast?

11:17.310 --> 11:18.690
Even a seasoned ghostwriter

11:18.690 --> 11:21.480
would need quite a while to copy
all those essays I gave you.

11:21.480 --> 11:23.540
How could you possibly be out so soon?

11:24.560 --> 11:26.040
I only wrote one sentence.

11:26.060 --> 11:27.060
One sentence?

11:28.330 --> 11:31.060
Qin Yuren has always
valued order in the academy.

11:31.560 --> 11:32.800
What you did

11:32.800 --> 11:34.280
was utterly disrespectful—

11:34.280 --> 11:37.080
you practically stomped her dignity
into the mud.

11:37.120 --> 11:38.870
Master, don't worry.

11:38.890 --> 11:40.560
I really did
answer the question seriously.

11:40.560 --> 11:42.200
She asked us to write

11:42.200 --> 11:43.360
about choosing a husband,

11:43.360 --> 11:44.720
and what I most

11:45.240 --> 11:46.160
wanted to say was this...

11:46.080 --> 11:48.330
[On Choosing a Husband]

11:46.240 --> 11:48.650
"I'd rather grow old clinging
to a fragrant branch

11:48.650 --> 11:51.380
than dance with yellow leaves
in the autumn wind."

11:51.380 --> 11:52.620
Everyone says

11:52.760 --> 11:53.820
choosing a husband

11:54.200 --> 11:56.340
is the most important thing
in a woman's life,

11:56.340 --> 11:57.490
that becoming a wife

11:57.520 --> 11:59.200
is the only path

11:59.220 --> 12:00.620
available to her.

12:00.650 --> 12:01.520
I don't agree.

12:01.550 --> 12:03.090
I insist on walking my own path,

12:03.090 --> 12:04.680
even if it means going against tradition.

12:04.680 --> 12:05.680
Choose a husband?

12:07.370 --> 12:08.460
I refuse.

12:08.600 --> 12:09.320
She is...

12:09.520 --> 12:10.820
rather interesting.

12:12.370 --> 12:14.380
If you hadn't met in Lingya Tower,

12:14.410 --> 12:15.370
perhaps

12:15.670 --> 12:17.350
the two of you might have

12:17.520 --> 12:18.670
become kindred spirits and talked
through the night by candlelight.

12:18.670 --> 12:21.110
That Qin Yuren is arrogant
and cold-blooded.

12:21.110 --> 12:22.710
I wouldn't want
to exchange a single word with her.

12:22.710 --> 12:25.230
Actually, Qin Yuren
was never a truly wicked person.

12:25.230 --> 12:26.770
She was held back by her feelings,

12:26.770 --> 12:29.060
and later struck
by a terrible twist of fate.

12:29.060 --> 12:31.060
That's how she became who she is now.

12:33.300 --> 12:34.500
Master,

12:34.530 --> 12:35.450
are you saying

12:36.740 --> 12:38.140
you know her background?

12:41.200 --> 12:43.880
[Elite Academy]

12:49.080 --> 12:50.020
How did the exam go?

12:50.020 --> 12:50.950
Not bad, I guess.

12:51.130 --> 12:51.770
Yanzhi,

12:52.160 --> 12:53.080
where did you go?

12:53.080 --> 12:55.210
I've been looking everywhere for you.

12:56.600 --> 12:57.840
What are we going to do?

12:57.840 --> 12:59.440
Dao really seems determined

12:59.440 --> 13:01.300
to team up with those two sisters.

13:01.880 --> 13:02.940
Then what about us?

13:03.570 --> 13:05.370
It's fine. Don't worry about it.

13:10.640 --> 13:11.770
The results are out!

13:14.550 --> 13:16.850
[Elite Academy Competition Rankings]

13:20.820 --> 13:21.360
[No. 2 Bai Xiaohui]

13:21.110 --> 13:22.270
I'm second again.

13:21.360 --> 13:22.220
[No. 3 Bai Xiaoying]

13:22.270 --> 13:23.720
I'm third again.

13:23.550 --> 13:24.800
[No. 1 Nan Yanzhi]

13:24.240 --> 13:24.920
Yanzhi,

13:25.160 --> 13:26.480
you got first place!

13:26.500 --> 13:28.300
You actually took the top spot!

13:28.360 --> 13:29.800
You're amazing, Yanzhi!

13:29.800 --> 13:31.340
What's the point of her doing well

13:31.340 --> 13:34.200
when she's stuck with a teammate
dragging her down?

13:37.400 --> 13:39.360
I came in last.

13:41.800 --> 13:43.060
This isn't your fault.

13:43.560 --> 13:45.420
If Madam liked my paper,

13:45.450 --> 13:48.300
then she clearly wasn't looking
for conventional approaches.

13:48.300 --> 13:50.630
But our group could've taken first place.

13:51.320 --> 13:53.240
It's because my score was so low

13:53.280 --> 13:54.900
that I dragged everyone down.

13:54.900 --> 13:55.740
Look,

13:56.000 --> 13:56.910
it's Dao's name.

13:56.870 --> 13:58.320
[No. 4 Dao]

13:57.020 --> 13:58.810
Dao did pretty well, didn't she?

13:58.810 --> 14:00.050
Of course.

14:00.160 --> 14:02.160
Our Dao did exceptionally well.

14:02.160 --> 14:04.320
The three of us are definitely
going to come out on top this time.

14:04.320 --> 14:05.520
Dao,

14:06.040 --> 14:07.820
are you really not teaming up
with us anymore?

14:07.820 --> 14:08.900
You two...

14:09.120 --> 14:10.230
You are hopelessly dumb,

14:10.230 --> 14:11.130
and she turned in her paper early.

14:11.130 --> 14:11.830
Well...

14:11.960 --> 14:13.420
Can you really blame me?

14:13.890 --> 14:15.210
I trust all of you

14:15.240 --> 14:17.170
are already aware of your results.

14:17.540 --> 14:18.980
Next, I will announce

14:19.010 --> 14:20.770
the final group rankings.

14:20.620 --> 14:24.790
[Elite Academy Competition Rankings]

14:20.800 --> 14:23.560
There were 20 students
taking the exam this round,

14:23.560 --> 14:25.280
so it was impossible to divide everyone
evenly into groups of three.

14:25.280 --> 14:26.160
As a result,

14:26.390 --> 14:28.440
2 students were left without a group.

14:28.440 --> 14:30.280
Their group total score
was at a disadvantage,

14:30.280 --> 14:32.300
but fortunately, the 2 of them
scored high enough

14:32.210 --> 14:33.800
[Elite Academy Competition Rankings]

14:32.360 --> 14:34.560
that they didn't end up near the bottom.

14:35.850 --> 14:38.450
Bai Xiaohui, Bai Xiaoying—

14:38.500 --> 14:41.040
you were the two left without a group.

14:43.360 --> 14:44.820
Don't look at me like that.

14:45.290 --> 14:47.890
I can't stand self-righteous people
like you.

14:52.010 --> 14:53.570
The 3 of us came up here together,

14:53.570 --> 14:54.920
so naturally we're a team.

14:54.920 --> 14:56.560
How did you get tomorrow's exam questions?

14:56.560 --> 14:57.640
You don't need to worry about that.

14:57.640 --> 14:58.900
Just focus on the exam.

14:58.960 --> 15:00.690
What do you want me to do for you?

15:00.720 --> 15:01.760
Nothing more.

15:02.400 --> 15:03.980
Didn't we come up here together?

15:03.980 --> 15:05.290
It's only natural that we help each other.

15:05.290 --> 15:07.290
Then why not give the exam questions

15:07.600 --> 15:08.560
to Jiang Man?

15:11.020 --> 15:12.330
Jiang Man isn't strong enough
academically.

15:12.330 --> 15:13.890
If she suddenly scores too well,

15:13.890 --> 15:16.490
Qin Yuren will definitely
become suspicious.

15:18.240 --> 15:19.000
I know

15:19.280 --> 15:21.880
you're always on guard
around the people here,

15:22.430 --> 15:24.890
but as long as you still see me
as a companion,

15:25.120 --> 15:27.180
I'll stand by you through everything

15:27.510 --> 15:29.570
and treat you with complete honesty.

15:32.240 --> 15:33.280
How can you go back
on your word like this?

15:33.280 --> 15:34.320
You have no integrity at all!

15:34.320 --> 15:35.360
Shameless!

15:35.360 --> 15:36.420
You're a disgrace!

15:37.320 --> 15:39.380
I never promised you anything
in the first place.

15:39.380 --> 15:40.420
I already told you

15:40.450 --> 15:41.710
to stay away from me.

15:41.760 --> 15:43.600
You're the ones
who kept getting your hopes up.

15:43.600 --> 15:44.080
You...

15:44.080 --> 15:44.880
Enough.

15:46.160 --> 15:47.160
The groups have already been decided,

15:47.160 --> 15:48.160
so further discussion is pointless.

15:48.160 --> 15:51.360
Next, I will announce the top-ranked group
for this exam.

15:52.220 --> 15:53.760
Let us congratulate the three of them.

15:53.760 --> 15:54.520
Wait,

15:55.160 --> 15:56.000
Madam!

15:56.620 --> 15:58.130
I suddenly remembered something—

15:58.130 --> 16:00.410
I seem to have left something out.

16:00.430 --> 16:01.380
What did you leave out?

16:01.380 --> 16:03.600
I forgot to write my name
on my exam paper.

16:03.600 --> 16:05.240
So my result for this exam

16:06.200 --> 16:07.850
shouldn't count.

16:09.660 --> 16:11.630
Nan Yanzhi, have you lost your mind?

16:11.630 --> 16:13.010
Exactly, Yanzhi!

16:15.040 --> 16:17.650
Are you treating the Elite Academy exams

16:17.680 --> 16:19.160
as a joke?

16:22.160 --> 16:22.990
Madam,

16:23.400 --> 16:26.320
it's precisely because
I take the exam seriously

16:26.340 --> 16:27.980
that I chose to admit it.

16:28.120 --> 16:29.320
But this academy

16:29.320 --> 16:30.810
was never truly an academy,

16:30.810 --> 16:32.680
and you were never truly a teacher.

16:32.680 --> 16:34.020
So perhaps an omission like this

16:34.020 --> 16:35.950
is hardly worth making a fuss over.

16:37.560 --> 16:38.360
Very well.

16:39.170 --> 16:40.960
As a reward for your honesty,

16:41.440 --> 16:42.760
I'll grant your wish.

16:43.840 --> 16:44.440
Guards!

16:45.040 --> 16:46.240
This student's attitude is unacceptable.

16:46.240 --> 16:47.110
Her results are invalidated.

16:47.110 --> 16:47.720
What are you doing?

16:47.720 --> 16:49.050
Her results are voided.

16:49.120 --> 16:50.180
What are you doing?

16:50.480 --> 16:51.540
Let go of me!

17:00.970 --> 17:03.060
[First Meeting]

17:03.240 --> 17:04.319
Please...

17:04.319 --> 17:05.440
don't kill me!

17:43.240 --> 17:44.080
Nan Yanzhi,

17:44.960 --> 17:46.300
you're so soft-hearted,

17:46.300 --> 17:47.720
and you still want revenge?

17:47.720 --> 17:48.340
Master,

17:48.440 --> 17:49.720
please give me one more chance.

17:49.720 --> 17:51.250
I'll go kill him right now.

17:51.480 --> 17:52.600
Yanzhi,

17:53.200 --> 17:54.130
there's no need.

17:54.850 --> 17:56.410
You're too kind by nature.

17:56.880 --> 17:58.960
Lingya Tower is not a place
for someone like you.

17:58.960 --> 17:59.960
But Master,

18:00.120 --> 18:01.920
my mother was poisoned by Lingya Tower.

18:01.920 --> 18:03.520
I have to get the antidote!
